---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Practice — StillPoint" description="Between letting the tools take your voice and refusing them entirely, there is a third way. This is where it gets practiced — out loud, in the open, with other people.">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-content">
      <p class="epigraph-coin">Find a third way.</p>
      <p class="epigraph">
        <em>Between letting the tools take your voice and refusing them entirely, there is a third way.</em><br>
        <em>This is where it gets practiced — out loud, in the open, with other people.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="practice-content">

    <!-- If you felt the pull -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>If you felt the pull</h2>

      <p>Maybe you've noticed it: the quiet drift where the machine takes the first pass at something you
      should have thought through yourself. Or the opposite — the urge to cut the whole thing off, walk
      away, call it poison.</p>

      <p>Both are honest responses. Neither is the only one.</p>

      <p>You don't have to choose between driving blindly and never driving at all. You can learn to read the
      road — to stay engaged, keep your own voice, and use these tools to build things that hand you <em>more</em>
      independence, not less.</p>

      <p>That's the practice. It's a skill, not a side. And it's easier to keep when you're not doing it alone.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- The practice itself -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>The practice itself</h2>

      <p>Three units, each one teachable in a breath.</p>

      <div class="practice-unit">
        <h3>The Still Point</h3>
        <p>Thumb on the stone — or any stone, any coin, any object with some weight to it. One slow breath.
        Notice one real thing in the room: something you can name, something that's actually here. Five seconds.
        That's the whole practice. Every coin already teaches it; this is where it gets named.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="practice-unit">
        <h3>The Sit</h3>
        <p>Five minutes, once a day. No app, no streak counter, no check-in. You don't report to anything.
        This is the one wellness practice that never measures you — which is the point, and which is why it's
        harder than it sounds.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="practice-unit">
        <h3>The Still Hour</h3>
        <p>An hour together. Phones in a bowl. Something made by hand — bread, music, mending, anything that
        puts your body in the work. One round of "name one tension." No leader, no agenda past that, no
        permission needed to hold one. We're writing the one-pager so anyone can host it; that's coming.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why we hold our own keys -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Why we hold our own keys</h2>

      <p>Every story of waking up — the cave, the dome, the endless feed — has the same structure: the
      operators offer two exits, and both exits are framed by the operators. The third way isn't picking
      a better exit. It's owning the ground you stand on.</p>

      <p>That's why this runs on software we host, coins we print ourselves, and materials anyone can fork.
      A room someone else owns can change the rules on you. This one can't.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- What this is -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>What this is</h2>

      <p>StillPoint began as a story — a novel about people relearning how to be still in a world built to
      keep them moving. From the start it was made in the open, as a collaboration between a human and AI,
      and it never pretended otherwise. In a project about finding a humane way to use these tools, hiding
      how it was made would have been the only real lie.</p>

      <p>The story was the proof. This is where the proof becomes a practice you can join.</p>

      <p>Not a pyramid — nothing here is trying to scale you, harvest you, or rank you. Something more like a
      tipi: small, portable, communal, yours to take down and carry whenever you're ready to go somewhere else.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- What you're not signing up for -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>What you're not signing up for</h2>

      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>No guru. No one here has the answer you're supposed to follow.</li>
        <li>No hustle, no funnel, no growth target. Presence isn't a metric.</li>
        <li>No purity test. Skeptics, builders, and the unsure are all the right kind of person.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>This is small, and it's just beginning. That's the honest state of it.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Your first move -->
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Your first move</h2>

      <p>One thing, and it's not a task:</p>

      <p class="first-move"><strong>Come in, say who you are, and name one tension</strong> — the place <em>you</em> feel the pull between the pyramid
      and the tipi. Where the tools tempt you toward the extractive version, and where you'd rather build
      the humane one. No deliverable. Just honesty, out loud, where someone can meet it.</p>

      <p>That's how everyone starts. It's how we find each other.</p>

      <!-- WALLY: add your personal line here -->
    </section>

    <!-- Take the pattern -->
    <section class="section spore-block">
      <h2>Take the pattern</h2>

      <p>The coin print files and the Still Hour one-pager will be published here under CC&nbsp;BY-SA when
      they're ready. Print your own coins. Run your own Still Hours. You don't need permission from us —
      and eventually you won't need to come back here at all. That's what the license is for.</p>

      <p class="spore-note">Coin print files — coming &nbsp;·&nbsp; Still Hour one-pager — coming</p>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <p class="cta-label">Open the door</p>
      <a href="https://forum.stillpointproject.org" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Open the StillPoint forum">
        Open the door &rarr;
      </a>
      <p class="cta-note">
        This is early. One welcome post, one open room. The first few people in help shape what it becomes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- License note -->
    <footer class="practice-footer">
      <p>
        StillPoint is a human–AI collaboration, made and run in the open.
        Movement materials are shared under
        <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" class="license-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>;
        the novel remains the author's — free to read, rights reserved.
        That's the whole arrangement, stated plainly.
      </p>
    </footer>

  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '../styles/design-tokens.css';

  /* Page Header */
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-lg) var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .epigraph-coin {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--color-accent-1);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .epigraph {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .practice-content {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-lg) var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .section {
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-2xl);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .section strong {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Practice units */
  .practice-unit {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .practice-unit h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-accent-1);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .practice-unit p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* Spore block */
  .spore-block {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .spore-block h2 {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
  }

  .spore-note {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* Plain list — no bullet gymnastics, just clear items */
  .plain-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .plain-list li {
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    padding-left: 1.5em;
    position: relative;
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .plain-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent-1);
  }

  /* First move callout */
  .first-move {
    background: rgba(26, 42, 46, 0.6);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-2);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-section {
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto var(--space-2xl);
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--color-bg-accent) 0%,
      rgba(147, 102, 57, 0.1) 100%
    );
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .cta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .cta-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .cta-note code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--color-accent-2);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-accent-1);
    color: var(--color-bg-accent);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-2);
    color: var(--color-heading);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  /* Footer note */
  .practice-footer {
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .practice-footer p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .license-link {
    color: var(--color-accent-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .license-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .epigraph {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    }

    .practice-content {
      padding: 0 var(--space-md) var(--space-2xl);
    }

    .cta-section {
      padding: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .epigraph {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
